Cell["\<\
Mathematica does not allow infinite recursion indefinitely. 
After  a certain recursion depth is reached, Mathematica stops evaluation and \
generates an error shown in previous example.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"33bfce37-ed83-4804-b0d1-f73ef9793763"]
}, Open  ]],

